WEBVTT

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:19.320
A light so bright that it can't be hidden
Breaks the silence and resurrects in this world

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:30.070
The dry land quakes violently
Sparks clash as we risk our lives

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:37.790
Let a miracle occur, just one more time

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:44.950
The power to regain the pages of memories I lost long ago

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:53.020
The trusting heart pierces the darkness
Search for the place where the soul rests

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:59.250
The sharp glint in my unblinking eye burns

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:06.700
Two souls - light and shadow
To the future shown in the crystal

00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:13.310
Now moving  Overflowing in red  eyes

00:01:28.270 --> 00:01:33.520
Mahad defeated Diabound, and Bakura crumbled into dirt.

00:01:33.520 --> 00:01:35.510
But time stopped.

00:01:35.510 --> 00:01:41.270
Aknadin placed the Millennium Items into the tablet of the afterlife.

00:01:41.270 --> 00:01:44.330
Why haven’t I won?

00:01:44.330 --> 00:01:48.090
That's when I realized I was sitting at a huge table.

00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:52.920
This world is a dark RPG?

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:58.930
Great Shadow Magus

00:02:24.270 --> 00:02:25.520
Seto.

00:02:25.520 --> 00:02:27.250
Aknadin.

00:02:28.130 --> 00:02:31.320
Were you telling the truth?

00:02:31.330 --> 00:02:34.760
I'm your son?

00:02:34.770 --> 00:02:37.310
Yes, my son.

00:02:37.310 --> 00:02:40.300
Zorc will resurrect soon.

00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:46.840
Let's defeat the Pharaoh together so that you become the Pharaoh.

00:02:46.840 --> 00:02:49.650
Aknadin is my father...

00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:51.590
Come, Seto.

00:02:51.860 --> 00:02:55.520
Don’t listen to him.  He sold his soul to evil.

00:02:55.520 --> 00:02:58.890
Seto, you're a priest who serves the people.

00:02:58.890 --> 00:03:02.580
Work with the Pharaoh to protect the people and this land!

00:03:02.580 --> 00:03:03.400
Seto.

00:03:04.430 --> 00:03:05.400
Seto.

00:03:06.170 --> 00:03:11.360
Listen to the royal blood that flows within you.

00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:14.540
Don't turn away from your destiny!

00:03:19.520 --> 00:03:21.510
It's Bakura.

00:03:21.940 --> 00:03:24.520
Why is he here?

00:03:29.640 --> 00:03:31.480
Yugi!  And the chump!

00:03:35.060 --> 00:03:36.800
They’re unconscious.

00:03:41.820 --> 00:03:44.220
What happened here?

00:03:56.660 --> 00:03:57.650
What's this?

00:03:57.650 --> 00:04:00.090
Seto!  Don’t be tricked!

00:04:00.090 --> 00:04:04.180
It's our duty to protect this land!

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:06.340
So we must defeat Zorc!

00:04:06.340 --> 00:04:10.640
Don't let evil crush our motherland!

00:04:10.640 --> 00:04:13.080
Motherland?

00:04:13.080 --> 00:04:18.770
Then let me ask you this: Who has protected this motherland until now?

00:04:18.770 --> 00:04:21.770
Is it you?  No.

00:04:21.770 --> 00:04:23.710
Is it your father?

00:04:23.710 --> 00:04:26.520
What are you trying to say, Aknadin?

00:04:26.520 --> 00:04:32.150
My brother Aknamkanon couldn't protect this land.

00:04:32.150 --> 00:04:36.600
I, the younger brother, had to do everything.

00:04:46.590 --> 00:04:49.620
Big brother... I mean, Pharaoh...

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:55.370
No.  My country will not start wars with other countries.

00:04:56.090 --> 00:04:59.760
But Pharaoh, other countries are targeting us.

00:04:59.760 --> 00:05:02.730
They've already started preparing for war.

00:05:02.730 --> 00:05:04.480
If we don't attack first-

00:05:04.480 --> 00:05:07.410
Silence!  You overstep your bounds, Aknadin!

00:05:10.050 --> 00:05:12.960
I’m sorry, my brother.

00:05:12.960 --> 00:05:18.170
I know you care about me and this country.

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:22.500
But I will look for a solution that doesn’t involve war.

00:05:23.060 --> 00:05:24.240
Pharaoh...

00:05:24.240 --> 00:05:30.240
Hate creates more hate, leading to wars over and over.

00:05:30.240 --> 00:05:32.700
Aknadin, try to understand.

00:05:34.960 --> 00:05:37.690
But my predictions were correct.

00:05:38.700 --> 00:05:42.350
Due to the foolish Pharaoh, thousands of soldiers died.

00:05:50.570 --> 00:05:52.680
But the people still...

00:06:01.770 --> 00:06:06.040
He was clearly still the Pharaoh.

00:06:06.040 --> 00:06:11.480
That's when I decided that if my brother is the light, I'll be the shadow.

00:06:11.480 --> 00:06:14.180
Even if it means I'll have blood on my hands.

00:06:46.850 --> 00:06:52.060
With the power of the Millennium Items, I saved the country-

00:06:52.060 --> 00:06:53.820
No, I saved my brother.

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:02.800
Why, Aknadin?

00:07:02.800 --> 00:07:08.830
If you cared so much about Aknamkanon, why betray him now?

00:07:08.830 --> 00:07:13.500
Shimon, don’t use vulgar words like “betray.”

00:07:13.500 --> 00:07:15.890
You know nothing of our relationship.

00:07:15.890 --> 00:07:19.000
You used Aknamkanon.

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:22.350
You drowned yourself in darkness.

00:07:22.350 --> 00:07:25.120
How dare you, Hasan!

00:07:25.120 --> 00:07:32.340
Since you were the Pharaoh’s guardian, you know the truth about my and Aknamkanon's birth.

00:07:32.340 --> 00:07:34.800
That we were twins!

00:07:35.080 --> 00:07:36.240
Twins?

00:07:36.240 --> 00:07:42.240
We were born at the same time, but Aknamkanon was chosen as the older brother.

00:07:42.240 --> 00:07:47.680
Only because he cried louder than me!

00:07:48.080 --> 00:07:51.270
So you knew about this...

00:07:51.270 --> 00:07:52.520
Aknadin.

00:07:52.520 --> 00:07:55.980
But I still served my brother.

00:07:56.480 --> 00:07:57.960
And left my wife.

00:07:57.960 --> 00:07:59.580
And Seto.

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:06.020
Even after my hands were drenched in the blood of the innocent, I stayed loyal.

00:08:14.830 --> 00:08:18.190
But Seto, you came back.

00:08:19.740 --> 00:08:21.470
Back to me.

00:08:22.120 --> 00:08:27.360
Seto, don’t you feel this is destiny?

00:08:27.720 --> 00:08:33.360
I was told my father died on the battlefield.

00:08:34.420 --> 00:08:38.980
As a priest, I wanted to serve this country and the Pharaoh.

00:08:38.980 --> 00:08:44.240
And you're the one who helped me, Aknadin.

00:08:44.240 --> 00:08:49.700
You were like a father to me.  But...

00:09:01.560 --> 00:09:04.610
...that’s because you knew I was your son.

00:09:04.610 --> 00:09:07.500
That’s why you helped me.

00:09:10.660 --> 00:09:15.600
Why tell me that you’re my father now?

00:09:15.600 --> 00:09:18.600
Seto, remember the white dragon.

00:09:18.600 --> 00:09:22.460
That white dragon will lead you to your destiny.

00:09:22.460 --> 00:09:25.040
Seto, you were chosen!

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:26.610
White dragon?

00:09:40.710 --> 00:09:44.140
The white dragon is my destiny...

00:09:44.140 --> 00:09:46.340
I will become the Pharaoh...

00:09:48.310 --> 00:09:52.740
White Dragon...  Blue-Eyes White Dragon?

00:09:53.260 --> 00:09:58.670
If Zorc destroys this land, everything will be gone!

00:09:58.670 --> 00:10:02.290
What’s the point of becoming Pharaoh after everything is gone?

00:10:02.290 --> 00:10:04.250
Seto!  Don’t be fooled!

00:10:06.020 --> 00:10:06.890
Pharaoh!

00:10:08.170 --> 00:10:09.330
Aknadin!

00:10:09.730 --> 00:10:11.650
Don’t you understand, Seto?

00:10:11.650 --> 00:10:16.620
When Zorc resurrects, this land will become a world of darkness.

00:10:16.620 --> 00:10:21.970
We will worship Zorc as our god and create a new world.

00:10:21.970 --> 00:10:26.480
And you will rule this new world as the Pharaoh!

00:10:26.480 --> 00:10:28.200
The Dark Pharaoh!

00:10:28.710 --> 00:10:30.140
Dark Pharaoh?

00:10:30.140 --> 00:10:33.140
Join me!  Your path is set!

00:10:33.140 --> 00:10:36.040
Join your father!

00:10:37.140 --> 00:10:38.510
Father...

00:10:38.780 --> 00:10:40.450
Seto...

00:10:45.720 --> 00:10:47.490
S-Seto...

00:10:48.260 --> 00:10:49.880
Don't...

00:11:04.760 --> 00:11:06.870
Join me, Seto.

00:11:06.870 --> 00:11:07.810
Seto!

00:11:08.300 --> 00:11:09.780
Father...

00:11:14.970 --> 00:11:17.200
That's the white dragon!

00:11:17.200 --> 00:11:20.120
Seto!  You are the true Pharaoh!

00:11:20.120 --> 00:11:24.490
Enough!  The darkness hasn't overtaken the land yet!

00:11:24.490 --> 00:11:28.730
Seto!  We must work together to defeat Zorc!

00:11:29.010 --> 00:11:33.850
Seto!

00:11:38.110 --> 00:11:40.920
Don’t listen to them.  Join me, Seto!

00:11:40.920 --> 00:11:45.620
Aknadin!  Don't speak of the Pharaoh when you're controlled by darkness!

00:11:45.620 --> 00:11:48.060
I'm not listening to you!

00:11:48.060 --> 00:11:50.650
Instead of waiting for Zorc to resurrect...

00:11:50.650 --> 00:11:54.090
...I’ll kill the Pharaoh now and destroy the light!

00:11:57.560 --> 00:11:59.840
Now die!

00:11:59.840 --> 00:12:02.640
And join Aknamkanon!

00:12:04.190 --> 00:12:05.080
Hasan!

00:12:05.080 --> 00:12:08.070
Pharaoh, I'll hold him back.

00:12:08.070 --> 00:12:10.430
I won't let him hurt you.

00:12:10.430 --> 00:12:11.520
Hasan...

00:12:17.140 --> 00:12:18.920
Seto...

00:12:24.980 --> 00:12:27.600
That’s right.  Keep running.

00:12:27.600 --> 00:12:30.970
I need you to join Seto.

00:12:32.270 --> 00:12:33.440
Now then...

00:12:37.890 --> 00:12:42.000
I’m hungry.  There’s nothing to eat.

00:12:42.000 --> 00:12:46.780
When time stopped, only he was able to move.

00:12:46.780 --> 00:12:52.370
Does that mean neither Yugi nor I can affect this NPC?

00:12:52.370 --> 00:12:56.470
Hey Fatso, what's your role in this game?

00:12:59.890 --> 00:13:02.350
Be quiet, you fool!

00:13:04.060 --> 00:13:05.830
What are you doing, Honda?

00:13:06.910 --> 00:13:08.510
N-Nothing.

00:13:08.930 --> 00:13:10.980
Why is Bobasa crying?

00:13:10.980 --> 00:13:12.580
I don’t know.

00:13:12.580 --> 00:13:14.510
What’s wrong, Bobasa?

00:13:14.510 --> 00:13:16.630
I’m hungry!

00:13:19.820 --> 00:13:22.150
I'm suddenly hungry too.

00:13:22.150 --> 00:13:24.260
Me too.  I can’t move.

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:30.180
I smell food.  This must've been a food storage room.

00:13:30.180 --> 00:13:33.330
What?  But it’s empty!

00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:35.240
Bobasa, did you...

00:13:35.240 --> 00:13:36.760
Eat everything?

00:13:36.760 --> 00:13:41.090
You could've saved a little bit for us!

00:13:41.090 --> 00:13:43.420
But Bobasa was hungry!

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:47.190
We shouldn’t be wasting time here.

00:13:47.190 --> 00:13:49.980
Let's go find the Pharaoh’s name.

00:13:50.710 --> 00:13:54.160
But we searched everywhere and found nothing.

00:13:54.160 --> 00:13:56.540
Maybe it’s not in the palace.

00:13:56.540 --> 00:13:58.840
I agree.

00:13:58.840 --> 00:14:00.990
If it’s not here, it's somewhere else.

00:14:00.990 --> 00:14:02.580
Then let’s go.

00:14:02.580 --> 00:14:06.440
Yeah.  No point sticking around here.

00:14:06.440 --> 00:14:09.990
Bobasa is too hungry to move!

00:14:09.990 --> 00:14:12.800
Just deal with it, like us!  Stand up!

00:14:12.800 --> 00:14:15.010
Leave him be.

00:14:15.010 --> 00:14:17.600
It’s not like he’s helpful.

00:14:17.600 --> 00:14:19.920
That’s true, but...

00:14:19.920 --> 00:14:22.540
But that’s not nice.

00:14:22.540 --> 00:14:25.230
But he can’t move!

00:14:25.230 --> 00:14:29.760
Let's find food for him.

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:32.660
Yeah.  It's the least we can do.

00:14:32.660 --> 00:14:35.660
Are you serious?

00:14:35.660 --> 00:14:37.080
Oh well.

00:14:45.990 --> 00:14:48.640
What are they thinking?

00:14:48.640 --> 00:14:51.430
Are they so hungry that they can't think straight?

00:14:58.280 --> 00:15:00.250
Bobasa is hungry.

00:15:00.250 --> 00:15:02.180
We’re almost there, Bobasa.

00:15:02.180 --> 00:15:07.130
You have to grab it because our hands pass through it.

00:15:10.920 --> 00:15:12.490
Bobasa, right there!

00:15:13.810 --> 00:15:15.490
Grapes!

00:15:18.390 --> 00:15:19.360
Everyone?

00:15:20.700 --> 00:15:22.310
We're exhausted!

00:15:22.310 --> 00:15:24.230
I'm hungry.

00:15:24.230 --> 00:15:27.240
That’s why we found it for you.  Eat up.

00:15:27.240 --> 00:15:29.350
Yeah.  Eat up, Bobasa.

00:15:29.350 --> 00:15:30.170
Enjoy!

00:15:30.170 --> 00:15:33.110
Really?

00:15:33.110 --> 00:15:36.700
Just eat it already!

00:15:36.700 --> 00:15:37.790
Or I will!

00:15:45.090 --> 00:15:47.210
Seems delicious.

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:48.100
Yeah.

00:15:48.100 --> 00:15:50.030
Happy, Bobasa?

00:15:52.660 --> 00:15:53.970
W-What?

00:15:53.970 --> 00:15:59.440
Since Bobasa is no longer hungry, I'll grant your wish.

00:15:59.440 --> 00:16:01.810
Get on my back.

00:16:01.810 --> 00:16:03.210
What’s going on?

00:16:03.210 --> 00:16:05.050
Leave everything to Bobasa.

00:16:05.050 --> 00:16:08.050
Let’s do what Bobasa says.

00:16:08.630 --> 00:16:09.620
Yugi.

00:16:09.620 --> 00:16:11.410
Are you sure?

00:16:16.880 --> 00:16:19.820
You want to know the Pharaoh’s name.

00:16:19.820 --> 00:16:22.830
Bobasa, you know the Pharaoh’s name?

00:16:22.830 --> 00:16:24.570
No.

00:16:24.570 --> 00:16:27.220
What?  You don’t?

00:16:27.220 --> 00:16:29.830
But I know where it is.

00:16:29.830 --> 00:16:31.260
What do you mean?

00:16:32.500 --> 00:16:35.260
He's part of the game script.

00:16:35.260 --> 00:16:38.820
A secret switch to find the eighth key.

00:16:39.440 --> 00:16:43.220
If if wasn't for Yugi, I wouldn't have known this switch.

00:16:52.660 --> 00:16:57.070
The “Bo” in “Bobasa” stands for “gluttony.”

00:16:57.070 --> 00:17:01.880
The “Ba” in “Bobasa” stands for “dinner."

00:17:01.880 --> 00:17:04.990
The “Bo” in “Bobasa” stands for “gluttony.”

00:17:04.990 --> 00:17:07.000
Bobasa is having fun.

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:11.580
But what does the “Sa” stand for?

00:17:14.100 --> 00:17:15.250
There!

00:17:15.250 --> 00:17:18.930
Isn't that the Valley of the Kings?

00:17:18.930 --> 00:17:22.110
The Pharaohs' graves are at the Valley of the Kings.

00:17:22.110 --> 00:17:26.840
Oh yeah!  I heard they build the Pharaoh’s tomb while he’s still alive.

00:17:26.840 --> 00:17:32.790
So my other self's name may still be engraved on the Pharaoh’s tomb.

00:17:38.630 --> 00:17:42.570
I've finally arrived at the eighth key!

00:17:42.570 --> 00:17:44.460
Thank you, Bobasa.

00:17:45.090 --> 00:17:52.010
Since you were kind and gave Bobasa grapes, I’m no longer hungry.

00:17:52.660 --> 00:17:56.230
Weird.  I feel full too.

00:17:56.230 --> 00:17:57.780
Same here.

00:17:57.780 --> 00:17:59.750
That’s weird.  Me too.

00:17:59.750 --> 00:18:02.960
Does that mean we were hungry because...

00:18:03.610 --> 00:18:05.080
Because of you?

00:18:05.080 --> 00:18:07.750
Don't worry.  You won't be hungry anymore.

00:18:07.750 --> 00:18:09.230
But...

00:18:09.230 --> 00:18:10.330
But?

00:18:10.330 --> 00:18:15.000
The “Bo” in “Bobasa” stands for “gluttony.”

00:18:15.000 --> 00:18:19.680
The “Ba” in “Bobasa” stands for “dinner.”

00:18:19.680 --> 00:18:21.340
The “Sa” in “Bobasa” stands for...

00:18:21.340 --> 00:18:23.150
He’s singing again.

00:18:23.150 --> 00:18:26.690
...Sayonara.

00:18:28.140 --> 00:18:29.210
Bobasa!

00:18:29.210 --> 00:18:30.250
No way!

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:30.990
Bobasa?

00:18:30.990 --> 00:18:32.560
Bobasa!

00:18:32.560 --> 00:18:33.660
Bobasa!

00:18:34.210 --> 00:18:36.130
Bobasa!

00:18:40.020 --> 00:18:41.490
I see.

00:18:42.000 --> 00:18:42.930
What?

00:18:42.930 --> 00:18:46.700
Your friends are doing well.

00:18:46.700 --> 00:18:49.800
They’re getting closer to your name.

00:18:49.800 --> 00:18:53.330
They are?  How do you know?

00:18:53.330 --> 00:18:57.060
A Master can't know the movements of NPCs!

00:18:57.060 --> 00:18:58.740
I wonder how.

00:18:59.910 --> 00:19:07.860
The countdown to my - I mean Zorc's - resurrection is near.

00:19:08.360 --> 00:19:10.860
We’re near the climax.

00:19:10.860 --> 00:19:15.300
It’ll be boring if our main cast can't do anything.

00:19:19.410 --> 00:19:20.200
Hasan!

00:19:22.280 --> 00:19:26.160
Your piece is tough.

00:19:26.160 --> 00:19:29.510
I won’t let you do whatever you want!

00:19:29.510 --> 00:19:31.920
Let me stir things up a bit.

00:19:31.920 --> 00:19:37.280
We need a main character during Zorc’s resurrection.

00:19:37.280 --> 00:19:38.640
Main character?

00:19:38.640 --> 00:19:43.960
Your partner shared his Ba with you before.

00:19:43.960 --> 00:19:46.960
Pull yourself together, my other self!

00:19:46.960 --> 00:19:48.900
We’re with you!

00:19:49.610 --> 00:19:53.680
I see.  I still had strength left.

00:19:53.680 --> 00:19:56.640
I still have my friends!

00:19:59.330 --> 00:20:03.990
So I'll do the same with my piece.

00:20:04.200 --> 00:20:05.420
Your piece?

00:20:05.420 --> 00:20:08.800
Yes.  I'll invite someone fun.

00:20:08.800 --> 00:20:13.500
I’ll bring him to this world and take some of his Ba.

00:20:13.500 --> 00:20:16.380
Make your entrance, CEO!

00:20:16.910 --> 00:20:18.900
You're bringing Kaiba?

00:20:21.490 --> 00:20:23.330
What’s this light?

00:20:31.950 --> 00:20:33.090
What?

00:20:41.780 --> 00:20:42.450
What?

00:20:44.880 --> 00:20:47.100
Where am I?

00:20:49.680 --> 00:20:53.330
I’ll borrow your soul, Kaiba.

00:20:53.330 --> 00:20:55.500
Just a little bit.

00:21:01.550 --> 00:21:02.310
Seto!

00:21:02.310 --> 00:21:05.650
I... will protect the Pharaoh!

00:21:05.650 --> 00:21:06.670
Seto!

00:21:27.390 --> 00:21:30.100
I’ve returned, Pharaoh.

00:21:30.100 --> 00:21:35.580
You pieces aren't special enough for the finale.

00:21:35.580 --> 00:21:39.040
You need me for the ending.

00:21:39.580 --> 00:21:40.980
Bakura...

00:21:59.870 --> 00:22:14.490
Right now, we don't need a map

00:22:14.650 --> 00:22:30.210
The miracle that tore through the darkness is in my hand

00:22:30.930 --> 00:22:36.050
Without a goal in mind

00:22:37.370 --> 00:22:44.620
We just step towards our dream

00:22:45.010 --> 00:22:50.260
EYE'S  As you sense it

00:22:50.450 --> 00:22:58.730
Your eye will find it

00:22:59.090 --> 00:23:04.540
Oh! EYE'S  What you wish for

00:23:05.330 --> 00:23:12.680
Will touch your soul

00:23:12.870 --> 00:23:15.940
In a duel

00:23:26.740 --> 00:23:32.020
Bobasa took us to the Pharaoh's name's location and vanished.

00:23:32.020 --> 00:23:36.800
Thank you, Bobasa!  We'll make sure to find the Pharaoh's name!

00:23:36.800 --> 00:23:42.480
Isn't this the tomb where Yugi's grandpa found the Millennium Puzzle?

00:23:42.480 --> 00:23:46.260
Bakura resurrected and broke up the Pharaoh's team...

00:23:46.260 --> 00:23:49.280
...so they can't interfere with Zorc's resurrection.

00:23:49.280 --> 00:23:52.460
